%% Phase2 / post / G-14a 模板消息“已收到”
%% Helix owners: outbound/engagement/template_received.rs; event/post/template.rs; channel/write/template.rs; port_reply/message_v3_template.rs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: templateReceived(postId)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_template_received", {postId})
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_template_received", {postId})
  else Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_template_received", {postId})
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 template post 与当前 actor，生成 corr_key
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST template-received
  Host->>Go: HTTP confirmation admission
  Go-->>Host: 2xx admission（不直接 Emit）
  Go-->>WS: WS post_update.template(receivedBy,event_seq)
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(post_update)
  E->>IM: parse template props and continuity
  alt next event_seq
    IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(message.template props + cursor)
    Host->>DB: commit confirmed actor set/count
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet message
    Host->>DB: readback template absolute props
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:updated(template props)
    Sink-->>UI: author/observer render confirmed actors
    Sink-->>FFI: batch raw post updated event
    Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw post updated event
  else duplicate/invalid actor/PersistErr
    IM-->>Sink: no success Emit；keep previous durable state
  end
  Note over UI,Web: template confirmation is idempotent；PC/Mobile/Web consume the same absolute props, not a local acknowledgement flag.
